From: Konstantin Komarov <almaz.alexandrovich@paragon-software.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 12:46:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04473/15333] fs/ntfs3: cosmetic fixes and improvements

Get rid of unnecessary duplications, improve readability, clang-format
the code.

Signed-off-by: Konstantin Komarov <almaz.alexandrovich@paragon-software.com>
---
 fs/ntfs3/dir.c     |  6 +++---
 fs/ntfs3/file.c    |  2 +-
 fs/ntfs3/frecord.c |  1 -
 fs/ntfs3/fslog.c   | 21 ++++++++-------------
 fs/ntfs3/index.c   |  7 +++----
 fs/ntfs3/inode.c   |  4 +++-
 fs/ntfs3/lznt.c    |  4 +++-
 fs/ntfs3/ntfs_fs.h |  6 +++---
 fs/ntfs3/run.c     |  9 +++++----
 fs/ntfs3/super.c   |  9 +++++----
 fs/ntfs3/xattr.c   |  1 -
 11 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

